\n[ ] CI related changes\r\n[ ] Other... Please describe:\r\n```\r\n\r\n## What is the current behavior?\r\nGRPC credentials were completly ignored on client side. It was no more possible to establish a secure SSL GRPC-connection. Further, it was no more possible to pass GRPC-arguments\r\n\r\nIssue Number: #4597\r\n\r\n\r\n## What is the new behavior?\r\nGRPC-credentials work again (as they have in Nestjs6). Additionaly, an `argument` parameter was added to the GRPC options, to pass any of the arguments defined in https://grpc.github.io/grpc/core/group__grpc__arg__keys.html\r\n\r\n## Does this PR introduce a breaking change?\r\n```\r\n[ ] Yes\r\n[x] No\r\n```\r\n","created_at":"2020-04-16T00:01:38Z","updated_at":"2020-05-24T11:55:52Z","closed_at":"2020-05-24T11:54:47Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"c765e756ed9b3b9aac21d17ab110ad5b593a4e4f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":851403452,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4NTE0MDM0NTI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/labels/scope:%20microservices","name":"scope: microservices","color":"e575a9","default":false,"description":""}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/pulls/4607/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/pulls/4607/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/issues/4607/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/statuses/2dcff086b3a346746da5e5c944a54acee405a6ea","head":{"label":"sjkummer:bugfix/grpc-options","ref":"bugfix/grpc-options","sha":"2dcff086b3a346746da5e5c944a54acee405a6ea","user":{"login":"sjkummer","id":9035698,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwMzU2OTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9035698?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sjkummer","html_url":"https://github.com/sjkummer","followers_url":"http